# Core hours

Core working hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026, as set by the board resolution of 15 September 2026. Where the board resolution and the staff handbook differ, the board resolution applies.

The staff handbook states that core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days, but this is overridden by the board resolution.

